<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>All costs and expenses incurred by the Department of Justice in the administration of this article, including those incurred pursuant to Section 17550.38, shall be paid to the department by the Travel Consumer Restitution Corporation. The department may institute an action for the recovery of costs and expenses incurred in the administration of this article in any court of competent jurisdiction.</p></caml:Content>